WEBVTT

00:14:29.747 --> 00:14:31.573
and get it wrong

00:14:31.597 --> 00:14:35.666
and actually find love
much later in life as well.

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:37.383
DB: Which is what's happened to us.

00:14:37.407 --> 00:14:38.568
And people always think,

00:14:38.592 --> 00:14:40.523
"When I think about a marriage decision,

00:14:40.547 --> 00:14:43.189
I should ask a lot of questions
about the other person."

00:14:43.213 --> 00:14:45.263
But maybe ask some
questions about yourself.

00:14:45.287 --> 00:14:46.842
Are you really ready to do this?

00:14:46.866 --> 00:14:48.726
Love and selfishness don't go together,

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.916
so are you still too selfish to really
be in a loving relationship?

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:55.436
There's a great -- Tim Keller,
who's a pastor here in town,

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.472
describes what happens in a marriage,

00:14:57.496 --> 00:15:00.932
that about six months into the marriage
or a year, a couple years,